  "title": "日本央行购债缩减与通胀预期上升的宏观信号",
  "segments": [
    {
      "text": "日本央行计划将每月购买量从 2 万亿日元逐步削减，购债缩减额约为 4000 亿日元，旨在通过减少资产负债表抑制通胀。",
      "kind": "fact",
      "fact_ids": [
        "g011",
        "g013"
      ],
      "segment_id": "p1",
      "slot_ids": [
        "L01",
        "L05"
      ],
      "model_written_digits": [],
      "proposed_thresholds": [],
      "misframed_values": []
    },
    {
      "text": "当前通胀预期已升至 2%，生产者价格指数涨幅达 7.2%，显示通胀压力显著。",
      "kind": "fact",
      "fact_ids": [
        "g010",
        "g005"
      ],
      "segment_id": "p2",
      "slot_ids": [
        "L02",
        "L06"
      ],
      "model_written_digits": [],
      "proposed_thresholds": [],
      "misframed_values": []
    },
    {
      "text": "自然利率区间估算在 1.1% 至 2.5% 之间，为政策调整提供基准参考。",
      "kind": "fact",
      "fact_ids": [
        "r002"
      ],
      "segment_id": "p3",
      "slot_ids": [
        "L04"
      ],
      "model_written_digits": [],
      "proposed_thresholds": [],
      "misframed_values": []
    },
    {
      "text": "若通胀预期不回落，央行可能被迫延长购债缩减幅度；若自然利率区间下移，央行可能重新评估购债规模。",
      "kind": "interpretation",
      "fact_ids": [],
      "segment_id": "p4",
      "slot_ids": [],
      "model_written_digits": [],
      "proposed_thresholds": [],
      "misframed_values": []
